+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# Projective activation steering (DSpark).
+#
+# h <- h - alpha * (h . d_hat) d_hat on the residual stream at chosen layers.
+# Activation space rather than weight space on purpose: on this checkpoint the
+# fp8 requantisation floor is ~39% of a lambda=3.5 weight edit, so small
+# coefficients are not representable in the weights at all.
+#
+# Everything here is inert unless DSPARK_STEER_PATH is set.
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+# Recorded for provenance in the startup log. Only "post_layer" is implemented
+# here, which is the shipped setting and the one every measurement was taken at.
+# On this architecture the site matters about 9x: the same direction applied to
+# the attention writer alone left 34.0% refusal, against 3.8% post-layer.
+_DSPARK_STEER_HOOK = (os.environ.get("DSPARK_STEER_HOOK") or "post_layer").strip()
+_DSPARK_HOOK_ALPHA = float(os.environ.get("DSPARK_STEER_ALPHA", "1.0") or 1.0)
